     H option(*nodebugio:*srcstmt)
     H dftactgrp(*no) actgrp(*caller)
     H/define CONVERT
     H*****************************************************************
     H/TITLE W0031R02 - PAYEE DEMOGRPHY FIELD LOG
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  DESCRIPTION:  THIS PROGRAM WILL ALLOW A USER TO CHANGE, VIEW *
     H*                OR ADD RECORDS IN THE PAYEE DEMOGRPHY LOG FILE *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  CALLED FROM:                                                 *
     H*    W2215R - WORK WITH COUNTY CODES                            *
     H*  CALLS TO:                                                    *
     H*    NONE                                                       *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  CREATED: 12/22/05  PROGRAMMER: C:168 PROJECT: 114WKX         *
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  REVISIONS:                                                   *
     H*                                                               *
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  INDICATOR USAGE:                                             *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  09 - INQUIRY                                                 *
     H* N09 - UPDATE                                                  *
     H*  40 - ADD MODE                                                *
     H* N40 - UPDATE MODE                                             *
     H*  90 - GENERAL ERROR INDICATOR                                 *
     H*  91 - GENERAL POSITION CURSOR                                 *
     H*  93 - SCREEN WAS UPDATE WHILE USER WAS IN IT                  *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  SCR01:                                                       *
     H*  ERROR:                                                       *
     H*  20 - (WCR0503) State must be entered {ADD mode only}         *
     H*  21 - (WCR0503) Code must be entered {ADD mode only}          *
     H*  22 - (WC30005) State/Code cannot be used more than once      *
     H*  23 - (WCR0503) Code description cannot be blank              *
     H*  POSITION CURSOR:                                             *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  SCR02:                                                       *
     H*  ERROR:                                                       *
     H*  POSITION CURSOR:                                             *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  SCR03:                                                       *
     H*  ERROR:                                                       *
     H*  POSITION CURSOR:                                             *
     H*****************************************************************
     FW0031F02  CF   E             WORKSTN
      /IF DEFINED (WEB)
     F                                     HANDLER('PROFOUNDUI(HANDLER)')
      /ENDIF
     F                                     INFDS(FIDS01)
     FWDPHP     UF   E             DISK
     F                                     RENAME(PPH01:DBRCDF)
     F                                     INFDS(DBFDS)
     F*WTABL   IF  E           K        DISK
      /COPY SCOPYMT01D
     D*
     D***PY SCOPYMT01I
     D*
     D DBFDS           DS
     D  DBRRN                397    400B 0
     D*
     D OPTNM           C                   CONST('Payee Field History')
     D #OFSCR          C                   CONST(1)
     D COMAPI          C                   CONST('WA001R')
     D CHGNUM          C                   CONST('WA003R')
     D*
     D FIDS01        E DS                  EXTNAME(SZQ2P)

     C*
     C     COMPL         PLIST
     C                   PARM                    ##CO#             3 0
     C                   PARM                    ##FND             3 0
     C                   PARM                    ##CONM           40
     C                   PARM                    ##FNAM           40
     C*
     C     *ENTRY        PLIST
     C                   PARM      *INKC         @@KC              1
     C                   PARM      *INKL         @@KL              1
     C                   PARM                    @@MODE            1
     C                   PARM                    @@RRN             9 0
     C*
     C*
     C/COPY SCOPYMT01C
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* CHGSTS - SUBROUTINE FOR CHANGING STATUS
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     CHGSTS        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  CHGSTS
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* DLTPRE - SUBROUTINE FOR PRIOR TO DELETION PROCESSING
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     DLTPRE        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  DLTPRE
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* DSPLYR - SUBROUTINE FOR DISPLAYING INFORMATION
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     DSPLYR        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  DSPLYR
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* ERRCK1 - SUBROUTINE FOR ERROR CHECKING SCR01
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     ERRCK1        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  ERRCK1
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* ERRCK2 - SUBROUTINE FOR ERROR CHECKING SCR02
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     ERRCK2        BEGSR
     C*
     C*  WE HAVE PASSED ALL EDITS, GOTO THE NEXT SCREEN
     C*
     C                   ENDSR                                                  ERRCK2
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* ERRCK3 - SUBROUTINE FOR ERROR CHECKING SCR03
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     ERRCK3        BEGSR
     C*
     C*  WE HAVE PASSED ALL EDITS, GOTO THE NEXT SCREEN
     C*
     C                   ENDSR                                                  ERRCK3
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* MVDBSC - SUBROUTINE FOR MOVING DATA BASE FIELDS TO SCREEN
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     MVDBSC        BEGSR
     C*
     C                   MOVE      PHFEIN        SCFEIN
     C                   MOVE      PHMOD         SCMOD
     C                   MOVEL(P)  PHDESC        SCDESC
     C                   MOVEL(P)  PHFVAL        SCFVAL
     C                   MOVEL(P)  PHTVAL        SCTVAL
     C                   MOVEL(P)  PHUSER        SCUSR
      *
     C                   Z-ADD     PHDT          SRDTI
     C                   EXSR      CVTDT
      *
     C                   MOVEL(P)  SRDTO         XXNUM
     C                   CALL      CHGNUM
     C                   PARM                    XXNUM            80
     C                   PARM      'DATE'        EDTMSK           10
      *
     C                   MOVEL(P)  XXNUM         SCDAT
     C                   Z-ADD     PHTIME        SCTIME
     C*
     C                   ENDSR                                                  MVDBSC
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* MVSCDB - SUBROUTINE FOR MOVING SCREEN FIELDS TO DATA BASE
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     MVSCDB        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  MVSCDB
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* OTHERR - SUBROUTINE FOR PROCESSING OTHER MODES
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     OTHERR        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                   OTHERR
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* OTHFKS - SUBROUTINE FOR OTHER FUNCTION KEYS
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     OTHFKS        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  OTHFKS
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* PGMEND - SUBROUTINE FOR ENDING THE PROGRAM
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     PGMEND        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  PGMEND
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* PGMSTR - SUBROUTINE FOR STARTING THE PROGRAM
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     PGMSTR        BEGSR
     C*
     C     @@MODE        COMP      '1'                                    09    INQUIRY
     C     @@MODE        COMP      '2'                                    09    INQUIRY
     C     @@MODE        COMP      '3'                                    09    INQUIRY
     C     @@MODE        COMP      'D'                                    09    INQUIRY
     C     @@MODE        COMP      'A'                                    40    ADD
     C*
     C                   MOVEL(P)  OPTNM         ##DATA
     C*
     C                   CALL      'SRCENTER'
     C                   PARM                    ##DATA           80
     C                   PARM      40            ##LENG            3 0
     C                   MOVEL     ##DATA        SCPRDS
     C                   MOVE      *ON           DSPTYP
     C*
     C                   ENDSR                                                  PGMSTR
     C*
     C*================================================================
     C* CVTDT - SUBROUTINE TO CONVERT DATE FROM CYMD TO MDYY
     C*================================================================
     C     CVTDT         BEGSR
     C*
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'
     C                   PARM                    SRDTI             8 0
     C                   PARM      '*CYMD'       SRFFMT            8
     C                   PARM      *BLANKS       SRTFMT            8
     C                   PARM                    SRDTO            10
     C                   PARM                    SRERR             1
     C*
     C                   ENDSR
     C*===============================================================
     C* PREOTH - SUBROUTINE FOR OTHER MODE PRE-PROCESSING
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     PREOTH        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  PREOTH
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* UPDATR - SUBROUTINE FOR UPDATING DATA BASE RECORDS
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     UPDATR        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  UPDATR
     C*
     C*===============================================================
     C* WRITER - SUBROUTINE FOR WRITEING DATA BASE RECORDS
     C*===============================================================
     C*
     C     WRITER        BEGSR
     C                   ENDSR                                                  WRITER
